WEBVTT

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.500
Hey...!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:22.710
C'mon!

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.740
Well, what now!?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.010
Are we stuck here 'til tomorrow morning!?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.710
Avdol!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.420
You...what's your plan, hey!?

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:37.690
That idiot...

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.380
It's too late to quiet yourselves now.

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.080
I know where the objects landed.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.880
You gotta be kidding!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:09.650
Don't move, don't fuss...

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.020
are you saying we should
stay this way until we die!?

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.520
What a pain.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:15.830
Enough is enough!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.220
You simpleton!

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.550
What!?

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:19.890
You...!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.010
Probably some cargo.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.450
He knows where things fell.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:42.920
Not good...!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.360
He absorbed more water.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.300
If this keeps up, we're finished!

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.630
- Polnareff, jump! -

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.170
- M-Me!? -

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.550
- Just make the jump! -

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:17.010
- You make it sound easy, but... -

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:36.570
Pol...!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.490
There you are...

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.330
I don't know who you are, but you'll go first.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:25.020
Footsteps...

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.250
five steps...

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.950
he's walking very stealthily.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.930
I hear...

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.560
It sounds like someone
is walking, doesn't it...

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.190
you Stand of water?

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.860
Now...come and attack that position.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.340
I'll burn you with my flames!

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.390
It's coming!

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.360
Wait!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.460
Why did he only take five steps...

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.860
and why hasn't he moved any further!?

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:19.300
What?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.830
Who is he?

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:49.930
Not a bad trick.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.540
From now on, I must listen to
the sounds more carefully.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.610
This burn...

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:00.250
that must have been Avdol just now.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.220
He's down!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.750
So powerful...!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.330
Avdol!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.170
This is...!

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.350
Water...!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:41.980
The sound!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.800
Thanks to the water I
combined with earlier...

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:52.030
I've been able to 'power-up.'

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.900
I'll drag you underground
along with the truck!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.070
My leg...!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.350
Mr. Joestar!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.300
Polnareff...

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:27.740
Jotaro!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:31.370
Look after Kakyoin and the others.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.910
What!? H-Hey!

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:35.800
Jotaro! Wait!

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.320
This time for sure, I hear someone running.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.290
Based on the stride, he's...

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.420
190...
(6'-3'')

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:48.990
No, 195cm.
(6'-5'')

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.930
Joseph Joestar is 195cm, but...

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:51.830
Wait...

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.600
the way he runs is youthful!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:54.930
The way he runs...

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.600
it's not someone trying
to escape on his own.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.830
In every step...

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.370
I feel his courage and confidence.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:02.930
It must be Jotaro!

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.010
The water is subsiding...

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.340
Jotaro!

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.060
The courage and confidence...

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.180
so that's him.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.920
I hear the most powerful Stand...

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.090
is Jotaro's 'Star Platinum.'

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.160
If I get rid of him, then Lord Dio...

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.290
would be very pleased indeed.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.200
Just watch, Jotaro!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:33.370
With all of my strength, I will defeat you!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.250
What are you doing!?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.550
Don't stop! Run!

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.650
That guy Jotaro...

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.360
before stopping, he picked
an object up from the sand.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.260
What...?

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:03.490
What was there on that spot?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.470
No, not an object!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:06.730
The dog!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.310
Jotaro grabbed the dog...!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.100
Did he figure it out?

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:12.610
What a pain.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:13.470
You...

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.910
escaped from the truck right
before we were attacked.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:19.010
You knew by scent...

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.520
where the enemy was coming from.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.750
Well, then...

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.120
I'm making you cooperate, Iggi.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.590
Where is he attacking us from?

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:30.790
Tell me, Iggi!

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.530
Although I'm not giving you the gum...

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.730
you'll die if you don't!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:13.870
He flew!?

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.570
You're not getting away!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.310
It can't be!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:22.340
The footsteps disappeared after the jump...

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.680
why isn't he landing!?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.710
Where...where is he?

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.360
I know I'm heavy...

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.830
but don't you even think
about escaping alone.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.270
If you try to shake me
off, I'll break your neck!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:50.670
Avdol...

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:51.640
how is he?

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.180
Yes...just a flesh wound.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.680
It missed his vitals.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.170
He'll be fine.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:58.610
Where's Jotaro...?

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.820
How clever...

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:04.890
Jotaro...

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:07.550
is having that dog look
for the enemy from above.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.730
If we can find the enemy's main body...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.860
there's a good chance of
defeating that formidable Stand!

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.400
B...But...

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:16.500
Mr. Joestar...

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.100
I'm worried!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.240
Their altitude is gradually dropping...

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:22.870
It seems 'The Fool...'

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:25.530
can't fly long distances!

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.950
I guess it can only glide
like a paper airplane.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:49.830
No choice...

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.880
We've made a lot of progress, but...

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.480
now we're really at disadvantage.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:05.850
How interesting...

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.540
that dog's Stand...

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.150
it can fly through the air, too!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.880
Not only that, but it's
heading in my direction!

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.120
Jotaro...

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.780
I must defeat him before
he comes too close.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.920
The water has started chasing Jotaro!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.190
His kick, earlier...

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.310
it must have detected it!

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:32.630
Alas, this battle is in Jotaro's hands.

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:47.270
It's coming after us.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.670
It brought the helicopter down...

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.980
but it's not like 'The Fool'
is making any sound.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.810
There's no way it can figure
out our exact position.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.480
I found you!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.080
Distance to the main body...

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.950
about 1.2 kilometers!
(3/4 of a mile)

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.290
It seems our enemy...

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.330
is a man with a vision problem.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.670
Sand...!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.340
Sand is falling...!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.090
That guy!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.460
Blowing the sand...up into the air.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.300
Not good!

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.800
The reflective sounds!

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:25.240
Like a sonar of a submarine...

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:28.310
I can hear it, Jotaro!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.670
Now I know your exact position and height!

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:31.680
SHOOT HIM!

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.380
Star Platinum!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.520
No matter how fast Star Platinum is...

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.220
if it can't figure out the
direction I'm attacking from...

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.090
I'll be a moment faster!

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.280
One more blow...

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:13.210
Y...

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:15.120
You damned dog!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:22.860
Is that dog trying to abandon
Jotaro in order to save himself?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.240
Bastard!

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:35.040
What a cowardly dog
you have as a comrade.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.540
Well, then, I will gratefully...

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.120
put an end to...

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:50.790
What!?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.450
He threw something towards me!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.220
It's Iggi.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.260
Hey, hey...

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.960
If you don't call your Stands and defend
yourselves, you'll ram into each other!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.440
Wha...

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:18.380
What a guy, that Jotaro...

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.550
All I needed was one more
blow to finish him off.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:26.890
Damn!

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:28.820
The dog distracted me...

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.360
I wasn't able to confirm Jotaro's position!

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:34.290
I've lost Jotaro!

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.300
Where could he be?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.280
Where is he!?

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:52.450
He's not moving...

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.750
he's somewhere, staying still...

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:56.980
Is this his strategy?.

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.100
Where are you...

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.690
Jotaro!

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:33.700
I see...

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:37.430
I didn't expect you to be so close.

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:41.560
If I hadn't guarded my
surroundings with this Stand...

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.730
I could've been defeated
by an attack from behind.

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:49.810
Ah, well...this cane...

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:53.280
I don't need to detect
sounds with it anymore.

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:54.540
However...

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:57.680
this cane will be needed on the way back!

00:23:51.510 --> 00:23:55.610
You blew away the cap that I never
remove, even when I go to the ocean.

00:23:55.750 --> 00:23:57.080
But, don't worry...

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:58.910
your wound is not fatal.

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:05.450
You...!

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:13.190
Idiot!

00:24:13.560 --> 00:24:15.030
What made you do that!?

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:17.460
Jotaro...

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:20.130
About me...

00:24:20.270 --> 00:24:27.010
weren't you planning to force me to talk
about the Stand users you'll be facing?

00:24:27.380 --> 00:24:29.780
I refuse to say anything...

00:24:29.910 --> 00:24:33.180
that will disadvantage him in any way.

00:24:37.590 --> 00:24:38.650
Dio...?

00:24:40.390 --> 00:24:41.380
You guys...

00:24:41.530 --> 00:24:43.550
why would you go this far?

00:24:43.990 --> 00:24:45.190
Jotaro...

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:48.290
I'm not afraid of dying...

00:24:48.430 --> 00:24:50.870
not afraid one bit.

00:24:52.540 --> 00:24:54.470
Because of my Stand ability...

00:24:54.610 --> 00:24:56.130
even as a child...

00:24:56.610 --> 00:25:00.370
I was never afraid of dying.

00:25:04.550 --> 00:25:07.750
The fact that I was blind
did not bother me either.

00:25:07.890 --> 00:25:13.050
I was able to defeat anyone, and
committing murder meant nothing to me.

00:25:15.260 --> 00:25:17.090
But, even I...

00:25:17.230 --> 00:25:18.130
for the first time...

00:25:18.260 --> 00:25:21.660
I felt that, 'I don't want to
be killed by that man...'

00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:25.360
I felt that from the bottom of my heart...

00:25:29.610 --> 00:25:31.300
That man...

00:25:31.440 --> 00:25:32.970
is so very strong...

00:25:33.110 --> 00:25:34.100
profound...

00:25:34.250 --> 00:25:35.210
bold...

00:25:35.350 --> 00:25:36.470
beautiful.

00:25:36.950 --> 00:25:40.940
And he was the first man in this
world to believe in my worth.

00:25:41.320 --> 00:25:42.950
To meet someone like him...

00:25:43.090 --> 00:25:43.750
I...

00:25:43.890 --> 00:25:46.050
had been waiting a very long time.

00:25:50.360 --> 00:25:52.490
I am not afraid of dying...

00:25:52.900 --> 00:25:53.830
but...

00:25:54.200 --> 00:25:55.960
the thought of being abandoned...

00:25:56.100 --> 00:25:58.430
and killed by him...I can't bear it!

00:26:00.700 --> 00:26:04.440
Even the evil need a savior of evil ones...

00:26:12.050 --> 00:26:13.380
There is one thing...

00:26:13.520 --> 00:26:15.350
I will tell you.

00:26:16.990 --> 00:26:18.050
My name is...

00:26:18.190 --> 00:26:19.320
N'Dool.

00:26:19.690 --> 00:26:20.920
My Stand is...

00:26:21.590 --> 00:26:23.750
the origin of Tarot cards.

00:26:23.890 --> 00:26:26.290
One of 'The Nine Egyptian
Gods of Prosperity...'

00:26:26.430 --> 00:26:27.950
'God of Geb.'

00:26:28.930 --> 00:26:30.760
It is defined as...the deity of...

00:26:30.900 --> 00:26:31.930
Earth.

00:26:36.870 --> 00:26:38.710
The Nine Egyptian Gods of Prosperity?

00:26:38.840 --> 00:26:39.970
What are they?

00:26:40.310 --> 00:26:41.710
I'm only telling you...

00:26:41.850 --> 00:26:44.640
about my own Stand.

00:26:44.780 --> 00:26:45.870
That is...

00:26:46.020 --> 00:26:47.320
for a man who has defeated me...

00:26:47.320 --> 00:26:48.910
Jotaro...

00:26:49.050 --> 00:26:51.720
the least I can...

00:26:51.860 --> 00:26:52.950
do.

00:26:53.320 --> 00:26:54.450
You...

00:26:54.590 --> 00:26:57.290
what kind of face...?

00:26:57.430 --> 00:26:59.990
You are the first man I've
ever wished I could see.

00:27:03.900 --> 00:27:05.100
For your luck...

00:27:05.100 --> 00:27:07.230
I pray.

00:27:29.690 --> 00:27:31.850
Such a proud man.

00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:34.360
If we could've met you sooner...

00:27:34.500 --> 00:27:37.160
before you met Dio...

00:27:37.700 --> 00:27:40.430
maybe we could've been comrades.

00:27:41.710 --> 00:27:43.230
It's the least I can do...

00:27:43.370 --> 00:27:45.170
rest in peace by your cane...

00:27:45.310 --> 00:27:46.300
N'Dool.

00:27:51.780 --> 00:27:53.480
In any case...

00:27:54.080 --> 00:27:57.050
making fanatic believers
out of people...Dio...

00:27:58.520 --> 00:28:00.750
What kind of man is he?

00:28:10.230 --> 00:28:12.000
Hey, hey...don't be so defensive...

00:28:12.140 --> 00:28:14.570
I'm not upset at what happened earlier.

00:28:16.340 --> 00:28:18.370
If I put myself in your place...

00:28:18.510 --> 00:28:21.000
being forced into battle because
of human circumstance...

00:28:21.150 --> 00:28:23.200
must be really annoying.

00:28:23.810 --> 00:28:24.210
Here...

00:28:24.480 --> 00:28:25.740
have a piece of gum.

00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:36.120
What an uncute dog.

00:28:37.860 --> 00:28:39.060
Just be that way.

00:28:56.180 --> 00:28:57.740
I'll be damned.

00:28:58.150 --> 00:29:00.640
You can be pretty darn nice, huh.

00:29:03.850 --> 00:29:04.980
Thanks a lot.

00:29:08.130 --> 00:29:09.090
Gum...?

00:29:09.230 --> 00:29:09.660
Y...

00:29:09.790 --> 00:29:11.090
You damned dog!

00:29:18.540 --> 00:29:19.760
Heeey!

00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:21.740
Jotaro!

00:29:25.510 --> 00:29:27.310
Are you all right!?

00:29:30.480 --> 00:29:31.710
That guy Jotaro...

00:29:31.850 --> 00:29:32.750
seems to be fine!

00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:35.780
Heeey!

00:29:36.590 --> 00:29:37.150
Jotaro!

00:29:37.150 --> 00:29:38.880
What a pain.
Jotaro!

00:29:40.620 --> 00:29:42.890
Heeey!
